@startuml
!include common-theme.puml
title 中介者模式：筛选面板由统一协调者管理联动

class ActivityFilterMediator {
  +handleKeywordChange()
  +handleCampusChange()
  +handleCategoryChange()
  +resetPage()
  +refreshList()
}

class KeywordInput
class CampusSelect
class CategorySelect
class Pager
class ActivityListView

KeywordInput --> ActivityFilterMediator : onChange
CampusSelect --> ActivityFilterMediator : onChange
CategorySelect --> ActivityFilterMediator : onChange
Pager --> ActivityFilterMediator : onPageChange

ActivityFilterMediator --> Pager : 条件变化后重置分页
ActivityFilterMediator --> ActivityListView : 触发查询与渲染

note bottom of ActivityFilterMediator
把多个控件之间的联动逻辑集中起来，
避免页面组件两两直接依赖。
end note
@enduml
